ni\\antigravity\\scratch\\NagrikOne\\app\\globals.css) | +300 lines — all auth styles + 3D animation keyframes |\n\n### 🎨 Premium UI Added\n- Glassmorphism auth card with ambient cyan/violet orb glow\n- **Two-column login page**: animated civic network visual (left) + auth card (right)\n- Slow-rotating rings, floating service node chips (Municipal, Consumer, Utility, Banking)\n- Password strength bar, show/hide toggles, smooth tab transitions\n- `prefers-reduced-motion` supported\n\n### 🔒 OTP Backend Preserved\n`lib/auth/otp.ts`, `app/api/auth/otp/route.ts`, and `OtpVerification` DB model are **all untouched** — OTP is simply removed from the UI, ready to reintroduce later.\n\n---\n\n### ⚡ First thing you must do when running locally:\n\n```bash\n# After npm install, apply the schema change:\nnpm run db:push\n```\n\nThis adds `passwordHash` to your PostgreSQL `User` table — **without this, registration will fail**."}
